msgctxt "No known user"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Ceann ar bith"

msgid "User avatar"
msgstr "Abhatár an úsáideora"

msgid ""
"This e-mail address is already in use. Please supply a different e-mail "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideadh an seoladh ríomhphoist seo cheana. Cuir isteach seoladh "
"ríomhphoist eile."

msgid "This username is already taken. Please pick something else."
msgstr ""
"Tá an t-ainm úsáideora seo tógtha cheana féin. Roghnaigh rud éigin eile le "
"do thoil."

msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Ainm iomlán"

msgid "Name is also used in version control commits."
msgstr "Úsáidtear ainm freisin i gceangaltas rialaithe leagan."

msgid "Commit e-mail"
msgstr "Tiomantas r-phost"

msgid "Use account e-mail address"
msgstr "Úsáid seoladh ríomhphoist an chuntais"

msgid ""
"Used in version-control commits. The address stays in the repository forever "
"once changes are committed by Weblate."
msgstr ""
"A úsáidtear i leagan-rialú gealltanas. Fanann an seoladh sa stór go deo "
"nuair a bhíonn athruithe geallta ag Weblate."

msgid "Commit name"
msgstr "Ainm tiomantais"

msgid ""
"Used in version control commits. The name stays in the repository forever, "
"once changes are committed by Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear é i ngealltanais rialaithe leaganacha. Fanann an t-ainm sa "
"stórlann go deo, a luaithe a dhéanann Weblate athruithe."

msgid "Public e-mail"
msgstr "R-phost poiblí"

msgid "Hide e-mail address from public view"
msgstr "Folaigh seoladh r-phoist ó radharc an phobail"

#, python-format
msgid "Component list: %s"
msgstr "Liosta na ngnéithe: %s"

msgid "Account e-mail"
msgstr "Ríomhphost cuntais"

msgid ""
"Used for e-mail notifications and as a commit e-mail if it is not configured "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear é le haghaidh fógraí ríomhphoist agus mar r-phost geallta mura "
"bhfuil sé cumraithe thíos."

msgid "Human verification"
msgstr "Fíorú daonna"

#, python-format
msgctxt ""
"Question for a mathematics-based CAPTCHA, the %s is an arithmetic problem"
msgid "What is %s?"
msgstr "Céard é %s?"

#. Translators: Shown on wrong answer to the mathematics-based CAPTCHA
msgid "That was not correct, please try again."
msgstr "Freagra mícheart, bain triail as arís."

msgid "Validation failed, please try again."
msgstr "Theip ar bhailíochtú, bain triail eile as."

msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Ábhar"

msgid "Your name"
msgstr "D'ainm"

msgid "Your e-mail"
msgstr "Do r-phost"

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Teachtaireacht"

msgid ""
"Please contact us in English. Otherwise, we might not process your request."
msgstr ""
"Déan teagmháil linn i mBéarla le do thoil. Seachas sin, seans nach "
"ndéanfaimid d'iarratas a phróiseáil."

msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "R-phost"

msgid "An e-mail with a confirmation link will be sent here."
msgstr "Seolfar r-phost anseo le nasc deimhnithe."

msgid "New password"
msgstr "Pasfhocal nua"

msgid "New password confirmation"
msgstr "Deimhniúcháin an phasfhocail nua"

msgid "Regenerate API key"
msgstr "Athghin eochair API"

msgid ""
"Leave enabled to revoke the current API key and generate a new one. This is "
"recommended if you suspect your password was compromised. Disable it to keep "
"your current API key active after changing your password."
msgstr ""
"Fág cumasaithe chun an eochair API reatha a chúlghairm agus ceann nua a "
"ghiniúint. Moltar é seo má cheapann tú gur cuireadh do phasfhocal i mbaol. "
"Díchumasaigh é chun d’eochair API reatha a choinneáil gníomhach tar éis duit "
"do phasfhocal a athrú."

msgid "Your password has been changed."
msgstr "Athraíodh do phasfhocal."

msgid "Current password"
msgstr "Pasfhocal reatha"

msgid "Leave empty if you have not set a password yet."
msgstr "Fág folamh mura bhfuil pasfhocal socraithe agat fós."

msgid "You have entered an invalid password."
msgstr "Chuir tú isteach pasfhocal neamhbhailí."

msgid "Username or e-mail"
msgstr "Ainm úsáideora nó r-phost"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Pasfhocal"

msgid "Please enter the correct username and password."
msgstr "Cuir isteach an ainm úsáideora agus an pasfhocal i gceart."

msgid "This account is inactive."
msgstr "Tá an cuntas seo neamhghníomhach."

msgid "Component wide notifications"
msgstr "Fógraí ar fud na Comhpháirte"

msgid "Translation notifications"
msgstr "Fógraí aistriúcháin"

msgid "Use default setting"
msgstr "Úsáid an socrú réamhshocraithe"

msgid "Other projects"
msgstr "Tionscadail eile"

msgid "Watched projects"
msgstr "Féachadh ar thionscadail"

msgid "Managed projects"
msgstr "Tionscadail bainistithe"

msgid "Project: {}"
msgstr "Tionscadal: {}"

msgid "Component: {}"
msgstr "Gné: {}"

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in non-watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh tú fógra le haghaidh gach ceann de na himeachtaí seo sna "
"tionscadail nach leanann tú."

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in your watched "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh tú fógra le haghaidh gach ceann de na himeachtaí seo sna "
"tionscadail a leanann tú."

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in projects where you "
"have admin permissions."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh tú fógra le haghaidh gach ceann de na himeachtaí seo i "
"dtionscadail a bhfuil ceadanna riarthóra agat."

#, python-format
msgid "You will receive a notification for every such event in %(project)s."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh tú fógra le haghaidh gach ceann de na himeachtaí seo i "
"%(project)s."

#, python-format
msgid "You will receive a notification for every such event in %(component)s."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh tú fógra le haghaidh gach ceann de na himeachtaí seo i "
"%(component)s."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"non-watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhfaighidh tú na fógraí seo ach le haghaidh na teangacha a d'aistrigh tú "
"sna tionscadail nach leanann tú."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"your watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhfaighidh tú na fógraí seo ach le haghaidh na teangacha a d'aistrigh tú "
"sna tionscadail a leanann tú."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"projects where you have admin permissions."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhfaighidh tú na fógraí seo ach le haghaidh na teangacha a d'aistrigh tú "
"sna tionscadail a bhfuil ceadanna riarthóra agat."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"%(project)s."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhfaighidh tú na fógraí seo ach le haghaidh na teangacha a d'aistrigh tú "
"i %(project)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"%(component)s."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhfaighidh tú na fógraí seo ach le haghaidh na teangacha a d'aistrigh tú "
"i %(component)s."

msgid "Username"
msgstr "Ainm Úsáideora"

msgid "Date joined"
msgstr "Dáta a cláraíodh"

msgid "Translations made"
msgstr "Aistriúcháin déanta"

msgid "Suggestions made"
msgstr "Moltaí déanta"

msgid "Comments made"
msgstr "Tráchtaí déanta"

msgid "Screenshots uploaded"
msgstr "Gabhálacha scáileáin uaslódáilte"

msgid "The chosen sorting is not supported."
msgstr "Ní thacaítear leis an sórtáil roghnaithe."

msgid "Team"
msgstr "Foireann"

msgid "Add to a team"
msgstr "Cuir le foireann"

msgid "Name your authentication app"
msgstr "Ainmnigh d'aip fíordheimhnithe"

msgid "Verify the code from the app"
msgstr "Fíoraigh an cód ón aip"

msgid "Discard previously configured authentication apps"
msgstr "Scrios aipeanna fíordheimhnithe a cumraíodh roimhe seo"

msgid ""
"All previously configured authentication apps will be discarded upon "
"verification of the new app."
msgstr ""
"Scriosfar gach aip fíordheimhnithe a cumraíodh roimhe seo nuair a fhíorófar "
"an aip nua."

msgid ""
"Other two-factor methods (such as WebAuthn and security keys) won't be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Ní bheidh tionchar ar mhodhanna dhá fhachtóir eile (amhail WebAuthn agus "
"eochracha slándála)."

msgid "The entered token is not valid."
msgstr "Níl an comhartha iontrála bailí."

msgid "Recovery token"
msgstr "Comhartha aisghabhála"

msgid ""
"Recovery codes can only be used once. Remember to mark used ones as expired."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir cóid aisghabhála a úsáid ach uair amháin. Ná déan dearmad na cinn "
"a úsáideadh a mharcáil mar rud atá imithe in éag."

msgid "Enter the code from the app"
msgstr "Cuir isteach an cód as an aip"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password changed."
msgstr "Athraíodh an pasfhocal."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Rate limit exceeded for {scope} at {path}."
msgstr "Sáraíodh an teorainn ráta do {scope} ag {path}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Username changed from {old} to {new}."
msgstr "Athraíodh an t-ainm úsáideora ó {old} go {new}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "E-mail changed from {old} to {new}."
msgstr "Athraíodh an r-phost ó {old} go {new}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Full name changed from {old} to {new}."
msgstr "Athraíodh an t-ainm iomlán ó {old} go {new}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password reset requested."
msgstr "Athshocrú an phasfhocail iarrtha."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password reset confirmed, password turned off."
msgstr "Deimhníodh athshocrú an phasfhocail agus díchumasaíodh an pasfhocal."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Configured sign in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Síniú isteach cumraithe ag úsáid {method} ({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Removed sign in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Baineadh an síniú insteach ag úsáid {method} ({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Signed in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Sínithe isteach ag úsáid {method} ({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Signed in using {method} ({name}) from a new device."
msgstr "Sínithe isteach ag úsáid {method} ({name}) ó ghléas nua."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Somebody attempted to register with your e-mail."
msgstr "Rinne duine iarracht clárú le do r-phost."

msgid "Somebody attempted to register using your e-mail address."
msgstr "Rinne duine iarracht clárú le do sheoladh r-phoist."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not sign in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir síniú isteach ag úsáid {method} ({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Account locked due to many failed sign in attempts."
msgstr ""
"Ghlasáil an cuntas toisc gur rinneadh an iomarca trialach síniú isteach gan "
"rath."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Account locked by the site administrator."
msgstr "Cuntas faoi ghlas ag riarthóir an tsuímh."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Account and all private data removed."
msgstr "Scriosadh an cuntas agus na sonraí príobháideacha go léir."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Account removal confirmation sent to {email}."
msgstr ""
"Seoladh ríomhphost deimhniúcháin faoin gcuntas a scriosadh chuig {email}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Agreement with General Terms and Conditions {date}."
msgstr "Comhaontú le Téarmaí agus Coinníollacha Ginearálta {date}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Invited to {site_title} by {username}."
msgstr "Fuair tú cuireadh ó {username} chuig {site_title}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Accepted invitation from {username}."
msgstr "Glacadh an cuireadh ó {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Started trial period."
msgstr "Tosaíodh an tréimhse thástála."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sent confirmation mail to {email}."
msgstr "Seoladh r-phost deimhniúcháin chuig {email}."

msgid ""
"The system created a user to track authorship of translations uploaded by "
"other user."
msgstr ""
"Chruthaigh an córas úsáideoir chun údar na n-aistriúchán arna uaslódáil ag "
"úsáideoir eile a rianú."

msgid ""
"Account created externally from weblate.org for access to purchased services."
msgstr ""
"Cuntas cruthaithe go seachtrach ó weblate.org chun rochtain a fháil ar "
"sheirbhísí a ceannaíodh."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Access to project {project} was blocked."
msgstr "Cuireadh bac ar rochtain ar thionscadal {project}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "User was enabled by administrator."
msgstr "Chuir an riarthóir ar chumas an úsáideora."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "User was disabled by administrator."
msgstr "Dhíchumasaigh an riarthóir an t-úsáideoir."

msgid "User was disabled because the access has expired."
msgstr "Díchumasaíodh an t-úsáideoir mar gheall gur imigh an rochtain in éag."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was added to the site-wide {team} team by {username}."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an t-úsáideoir leis an bhfoireann {team} ar fud an tsuímh ag "
"{username}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User access to the site-wide {team} team was changed by {username}."
msgstr ""
"Athraíodh rochtain úsáideora ar fhoireann {team} ar fud an tsuímh ag "
"{username}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was removed from the site-wide {team} team by {username}."
msgstr ""
"Baineadh an t-úsáideoir as foireann {team} ar fud an tsuímh ag {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Superuser privileges granted."
msgstr "Bronnadh ceadanna an fhorúsáideora."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Superuser privileges revoked."
msgstr "Ceadanna an fhorúsáideora curtha ar ceal."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Semiannual support status review was displayed."
msgstr "Taispeánadh athbhreithniú stádais tacaíochta leathbhliantúil."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was added to the {team} team by {username}."
msgstr "Cuireadh úsáideoir leis an bhfoireann {team} trí {username}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User access to the {team} team was changed by {username}."
msgstr "Athraíodh rochtain úsáideora ar fhoireann {team} ag {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was removed from the {team} team by {username}."
msgstr "Baineadh an t-úsáideoir den fhoireann {team} le {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Project token for {project} was created."
msgstr "Cruthaíodh comhartha tionscadail do {project}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Project token for {project} was removed."
msgstr "Baineadh comhartha tionscadail do {project}."

msgid "Two-factor authentication recovery codes were generated"
msgstr "Gineadh cóid aisghabhála fíordheimhnithe dhá-fhachtóir"

msgid "Two-factor authentication recovery codes were viewed"
msgstr "Breathnaíodh ar chóid aisghabhála fíordheimhnithe dhá-fhachtóir"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication added: {device}"
msgstr "Cuireadh fíordheimhniú dhá-fhachtóir leis: {device}"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication removed: {device}"
msgstr "Baineadh fíordheimhniú dhá-fhachtóir: {device}"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication sign in using {device}"
msgstr "Síniú isteach fíordheimhnithe dhá-fhachtóir ag úsáid {device}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication failed using {device_type}"
msgstr "Theip ar fhíordheimhniú dhá fhachtóir ag baint úsáide as {device_type}"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Configured password to sign in."
msgstr "Socraíodh an pasfhocal le síniú isteach."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Signed in using password."
msgstr "Sínithe isteach leis an bpasfhocal."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Signed in using password from a new device."
msgstr "Sínithe isteach leis an bpasfhocal ar ghléas nua."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Could not sign in using password."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir síniú isteach leis an bpasfhocal."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Invited to {project} by {username}."
msgstr "Tugadh cuireadh go {project} ag {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password configured."
msgstr "Pasfhocal cumraithe."

msgid "To restore access to your account, please reset your password."
msgstr "Le rochtain ar do chuntas a fháil ar ais, athshocraigh do phasfhocal."

msgid "Please contact project maintainers if you feel this is inappropriate."
msgstr ""
"Déan teagmháil le cothaitheoirí tionscadail le do thoil má bhraitheann tú go "
"bhfuil sé seo míchuí."

msgid "If it was you, reset your password to regain access to your account."
msgstr ""
"Más tusa a bhí ann, athshocraigh do phasfhocal chun rochtain a fháil ar do "
"chuntas arís."

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "PC"
msgstr "Ríomhaire"

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Eile"

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "Generic Smartphone"
msgstr "Fón Cliste Cineálach"

msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "Generic Feature Phone"
msgstr "Fón Gnéithe Cineálach"

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "iOS-Device"
msgstr "Gléas iOS"

msgid "Account activity"
msgstr "Gníomhaíocht an chuntais"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Triggered by {username}."
msgstr "Spreagtha ag {username}."

msgid "Interface Language"
msgstr "Teanga an chomhéadain"

msgid "Translated languages"
msgstr "Teangacha aistrithe"

msgid ""
"Choose the languages you can translate to. These will be offered to you on "
"the dashboard for easier access to your chosen translations."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh na teangacha is féidir leat aistriú chucu. Taispeánfar duit ar an "
"deais iad le cabhrú leis an aistriúchán."

msgid "Secondary languages"
msgstr "Teangacha tánaisteacha"

msgid ""
"Choose languages you can understand, strings in those languages will be "
"shown in addition to the source string."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh na teangacha a thuigeann tú, taispeánfar teaghráin sna teangacha "
"sin in éindí leis an mbunteaghrán."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Téama"

msgid "Hide completed translations on the dashboard"
msgstr "Folaigh aistriúcháin déanta ar an deais"

msgid "Show secondary translations in the Zen mode"
msgstr "Taispeáin aistriúcháin tánaisteacha sa mhód Zen"

msgid "Hide source if a secondary translation exists"
msgstr "Folaigh an foinse má tá aistriúchán tánaisteach ann"

msgid "Show all columns in lists using horizontal scrolling"
msgstr "Taispeáin gach colún i liostaí ag baint úsáide as scrollú cothrománach"

msgid ""
"Instead of hiding columns on narrow screens, keep all columns and scroll the "
"table horizontally."
msgstr ""
"In ionad colúin a cheilt ar scáileáin chúng, coinnigh na colúin uile agus "
"scrollaigh an tábla go cothrománach."

msgid "Editor link"
msgstr "Nasc don eagarthóir"

msgid ""
"Enter a custom URL to be used as link to the source code. You can use "
"{{branch}} for branch, {{filename}} and {{line}} as filename and line "
"placeholders."
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach URL saincheaptha le húsáid mar nasc leis an gcód foinse. Is "
"féidir leat {{branch}} a úsáid le haghaidh brainse, {{filename}} agus "
"{{line}} mar chomhadainm agus áitshealbhóirí líne."

msgid "Translation editor mode"
msgstr "Modh eagarthóir aistriúcháin"

msgid "Full editor"
msgstr "Eagarthóir iomlán"

msgid "Zen mode"
msgstr "Modh zen"

msgid "Zen editor mode"
msgstr "Zen mód eagarthóir"

msgid "Top to bottom"
msgstr "Bun go barr"

msgid "Side by side"
msgstr "Taobh le taobh"

msgid "Special characters"
msgstr "Litreacha speisialta"

msgid ""
"You can specify additional special visual keyboard characters to be shown "
"while translating. It can be useful for characters you use frequently, but "
"are hard to type on your keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat carachtair mhéarchláir amhairc speisialta breise a shonrú a "
"thaispeánfar agus tú ag aistriú. Féadfaidh sé a bheith úsáideach do "
"charachtair a úsáideann tú go minic, ach is deacair iad a chlóscríobh ar do "
"mhéarchlár."

msgid "Number of nearby strings"
msgstr "Líon teaghráin in aice láimhe"

msgid "Number of nearby strings to show in each direction in the full editor."
msgstr ""
"Líon na teaghráin in aice láimhe le taispeáint i ngach treo san eagarthóir "
"iomlán."

msgid "Automatically watch projects on contribution"
msgstr "Féach go huathoibríoch ar thionscadail ar ranníocaíocht"

msgid ""
"Projects are added to your watched projects when you contribute to them."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear tionscadail leis na tionscadail atá á bhfaire agat nuair a "
"chuireann tú leo."

msgid "Contribute to personal translation memory"
msgstr "Cuir le cuimhne aistriúcháin phearsanta"

msgid ""
