msgstr "Úsáidtear an teanga tugtha mar theanga fhoinseach."

msgid "The language filter timed out."
msgstr "Chuaigh an scagaire teanga in éag."

msgid "The given language is filtered by the language filter."
msgstr "Tá an teanga tugtha scagtha ag an scagaire teanga."

msgid "Component discovery"
msgstr "Fionnachtain Comhpháirte"

msgid ""
"Automatically adds or removes project components based on file changes in "
"the version control system."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann nó baintear comhpháirteanna tionscadail go huathoibríoch bunaithe "
"ar athruithe comhaid sa chóras rialaithe leagain."

msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Ar feitheamh"

msgid "Success"
msgstr "Rath"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "Earráid"

msgid "Skipped"
msgstr "Scipeáilte"

msgid "The add-on is not compatible with this component."
msgstr "Níl an breiseán comhoiriúnach leis an gcomhpháirt seo."

msgid "There are no compatible components to process."
msgstr "Níl aon chomhpháirteanna comhoiriúnacha le próiseáil."

msgid "The add-on is not scheduled to run yet."
msgstr "Níl an breiseán sceidealaithe le rith go fóill."

msgid "There are no relevant changes to process."
msgstr "Níl aon athruithe ábhartha ar an bpróiseas."

msgid "Background processing is disabled."
msgstr "Tá próiseáil chúlra díchumasaithe."

msgid "The component is not scheduled for background processing today."
msgstr "Níl an chomhpháirt sceidealaithe le haghaidh próiseála cúlra inniu."

msgid "There are no eligible strings to process."
msgstr "Níl aon teaghráin incháilithe le próiseáil."

msgid "The target no longer exists."
msgstr "Níl an sprioc ann a thuilleadh."

msgid "A required file is not available."
msgstr "Níl comhad riachtanach ar fáil."

msgid "There are no outgoing commits to process."
msgstr "Níl aon ghealltanais amach le próiseáil."

msgid "The add-on does not apply to this event."
msgstr "Ní bhaineann an breiseán leis an ócáid seo."

msgid "No source files are configured."
msgstr "Níl aon chomhaid foinse cumraithe."

msgid "The configured output path is invalid."
msgstr "Tá an cosán aschuir cumraithe neamhbhailí."

msgid "The add-on execution failed."
msgstr "Theip ar fhorghníomhú an bhreiseáin."

msgid "Example add-on"
msgstr "Sampla de bhreiseán"

msgid "This add-on does nothing it is just an example."
msgstr "Ní dhéanann an breiseán seo rud ar bith. Níl ach sampla atá ann."

msgid "Execute script before commit"
msgstr "Rith an script roimh chimiú"

msgid "This add-on executes a script."
msgstr "Feidhmíonn an breiseán seo script."

msgid "Fedora Messaging"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí Fedora"

msgid "Sends notifications to a Fedora Messaging compatible AMQP exchange."
msgstr ""
"Seolann sé fógraí chuig malartán AMQP atá comhoiriúnach le Fedora Messaging."

#, python-format
msgid "Message ID: %(message_id)s"
msgstr "Aitheantas an Teachtaireachta: %(message_id)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Fedora Messaging publish timed out; the broker connection or delivery "
"confirmation did not complete: %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"Chuaigh foilsiú Teachtaireachtaí Fedora thar an am; níor críochnaíodh an "
"nasc bróicéara ná an dearbhú seachadta: %(error)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Fedora Messaging publisher service was unavailable; the connection will be "
"recreated on the next attempt: %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"Ní raibh seirbhís foilsitheora Fedora Messaging ar fáil; athchruthófar an "
"nasc ar an gcéad iarracht eile: %(error)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Fedora Messaging broker returned the message: %(error)s"
msgstr "D’fhill bróicéir Teachtaireachtaí Fedora an teachtaireacht: %(error)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Fedora Messaging broker rejected the message: %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"Dhiúltaigh bróicéir Teachtaireachtaí Fedora don teachtaireacht: %(error)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Fedora Messaging publish failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "Theip ar fhoilsiú Teachtaireachtaí Fedora: %(error)s"

msgid "configured"
msgstr "cumraithe"

msgid "Could not reset Fedora Messaging publisher service."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir seirbhís foilsitheora Fedora Teachtaireachtaí a athshocrú."

msgid "CA certificates must be valid PEM encoded X.509 certificates."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór deimhnithe CA a bheith bailí mar dheimhnithe X.509 atá ionchódaithe "
"le PEM."

msgid "Client SSL key must be an unencrypted PEM encoded private key."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór eochair SSL an chliaint a bheith ina heochair phríobháideach "
"neamhchriptithe atá ionchódaithe le PEM."

msgid "Client SSL certificates must be valid PEM encoded X.509 certificates."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór do theastais SSL cliant a bheith ina dteastais bhailí X.509 atá "
"ionchódaithe le PEM."

#, python-format
msgid "Fedora Messaging broker URL is invalid: %(error)s"
msgstr "Tá URL bróicéir Teachtaireachtaí Fedora neamhbhailí: %(error)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Could not verify TLS connection to the Fedora Messaging broker: %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir nasc TLS leis an mbróicéir Teachtaireachtaí Fedora a fhíorú: "
"%(error)s"

msgid "Flag new source strings as \"Needs checking\""
msgstr "Brataigh teaghráin foinse nua mar \"Riachtanas seiceála\""

msgid ""
"Whenever a new source string is imported from the VCS, it is flagged as "
"needing checking in Weblate. This way you can easily filter and edit source "
"strings written by the developers."
msgstr ""
"Aon uair a iompórtáiltear teaghrán foinse nua ón VCS, cuirtear bratach air "
"mar rud a bhfuil gá le seiceáil air i Weblate. Ar an mbealach seo is féidir "
"leat teaghráin foinse scríofa ag na forbróirí a scagadh agus a chur in eagar "
"go héasca."

msgid "Flag new translations as \"Needs rewriting\""
msgstr "Brataigh aistriúcháin nua mar \"Riachtanas athscríofa\""

msgid ""
"Whenever a new translatable string is imported from the VCS, it is flagged "
"as needing rewriting in Weblate. This way you can easily filter and edit "
"translations created by the developers."
msgstr ""
"Aon uair a allmhairítear teaghrán nua inaistrithe ón VCS, cuirtear bratach "
"air mar theaghrán a bhfuil gá é a athscríobh i Weblate. Ar an mbealach seo "
"is féidir leat aistriúcháin a chruthaigh na forbróirí a scagadh agus a chur "
"in eagar go héasca."

msgid "Flag unchanged translations as \"Needs rewriting\""
msgstr "Brataigh aistriúcháin gan athrú mar \"Riachtanas athscríofa\""

msgid ""
"Whenever a new translatable string is imported from the VCS and it matches a "
"source string, it is flagged as needing rewriting in Weblate. Especially "
"useful for file formats that include source strings for untranslated strings."
msgstr ""
"Aon uair a allmhairítear teaghrán nua inaistrithe ón VCS agus go bhfuil sé "
"ag teacht le teaghrán foinse, cuirtear bratach air mar theaghrán a bhfuil gá "
"é a athscríobh i Weblate. Tá sé seo an-úsáideach go háirithe i gcás formáidí "
"comhaid ina bhfuil teaghráin foinse do theaghráin neamhaistrithe."

msgid "Bulk edit"
msgstr "Bulc eagarthóireacht"

msgid "Bulk edit flags, labels, or states of strings."
msgstr "Bulceagrú bratacha, lipéid, nó stáit teaghráin."

msgid "Flag updated translations from repository as \"Needs rewriting\""
msgstr ""
"Brataigh aistriúcháin nuashonraithe ón stór mar \"Riachtanas athscríofa\""

msgid ""
"Whenever a string translation is changed from the VCS, it is flagged as "
"needing rewriting in Weblate. Especially useful if translation files are "
"often updated manually or by an external service."
msgstr ""
"Aon uair a athraítear aistriúchán teaghráin ón VCS, cuirtear bratach air mar "
"rud a bhfuil gá é a athscríobh i Weblate. Tá sé seo an-úsáideach go háirithe "
"má bhíonn comhaid aistriúcháin á nuashonrú de láimh nó ag seirbhís "
"sheachtrach go minic."

msgid "Path of generated MO file"
msgstr "Conair an chomhaid MO a ghintear"

msgid "If not specified, the location of the PO file will be used."
msgstr "Mura sonraítear é, úsáidfear suíomh an chomhaid PO."

msgid "Include strings needing editing"
msgstr "Cuir teaghráin ar gá eagarthóireacht a dhéanamh orthu"

msgid ""
"Strings needing editing (fuzzy) are typically not ready for use as "
"translations."
msgstr ""
"Go hiondúil ní bhíonn teaghráin ar gá eagarthóireacht a dhéanamh orthu "
"(doiléir) réidh le húsáid mar aistriúcháin."

msgid "Update frequency"
msgstr "Minicíocht nuashonraithe"

msgid "Daily"
msgstr "Laethúil"

msgid "Weekly"
msgstr "Seachtainiúil"

msgid "Monthly"
msgstr "Míosúil"

msgid ""
"How often the add-on should update the POT file when the component is "
"refreshed."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh minic ba chóir don bhreiseán an comhad POT a nuashonrú nuair a "
"athnuachantar an chomhpháirt."

msgid "Normalize POT header"
msgstr "Ceanntásc POT a normalú"

msgid "Updates gettext headers and replaces placeholder POT comments."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíonn sé ceanntásca gettext agus cuireann sé tuairimí POT in ionad "
"na n-áitchoinneálaí."

msgid "Update PO files using msgmerge"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh comhaid PO ag baint úsáide as msgmerge"

msgid ""
"Ensures the msgmerge add-on is installed and triggers it after the POT file "
"is updated."
msgstr ""
"Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil an breiseán msgmerge suiteáilte agus go spreagann sé "
"é tar éis an comhad POT a nuashonrú."

msgid "Source locations"
msgstr "Suíomhanna foinse"

msgid "Use file format settings"
msgstr "Úsáid socruithe formáide comhaid"

msgid "Extract locations to the POT file"
msgstr "Sliocht suíomhanna chuig an gcomhad POT"

msgid "Do not extract locations"
msgstr "Ná bain amach suíomhanna"

msgid ""
"Choose how extraction writes source locations to the POT file. Use this to "
"keep locations in the template while omitting them from translated PO files."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh conas a scríobhann eastóscadh suíomhanna foinse chuig an gcomhad "
"POT. Úsáid é seo chun suíomhanna a choinneáil sa teimpléad agus iad a "
"fhágáil ar lár ó chomhaid PO aistrithe."

msgid "Do not extract comments"
msgstr "Ná bain amach tuairimí"

msgid "Extract all comments"
msgstr "Bain amach na tuairimí go léir"

msgid "Extract comments with tag"
msgstr "Bain amach tuairimí leis an gclib"

msgid "Code comments"
msgstr "Tráchtanna ar chód"

msgid ""
"Choose whether xgettext should extract no comments, all comments, or only "
"comments marked with a specific tag."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an gcaithfidh xgettext gan aon tráchtanna, na tráchtanna uile, nó "
"tráchtanna atá marcáilte le clib shonrach amháin a bhaint amach."

msgid "Comment tag"
msgstr "Clib tráchta"

msgid ""
"Tag passed to xgettext for comment extraction when using tagged comment mode."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an chlib chuig xgettext le haghaidh eastóscadh tráchta agus mód "
"tráchta clibáilte in úsáid."

msgid "xgettext checks"
msgstr "seiceálacha xgettext"

msgid "Additional xgettext validation checks to enable for extracted messages."
msgstr ""
"Seiceálacha bailíochtaithe xgettext breise chun teachtaireachtaí eastósctha "
"a chumasú."

msgid "Additional keyword"
msgstr "Eochairfhocal breise"

msgid "Optional extra keyword passed to xgettext using --keyword."
msgstr ""
"Eochairfhocal breise roghnach a chuirtear chuig xgettext ag baint úsáide as "
"--keyword."

msgid "Use keywords exclusively"
msgstr "Úsáid eochairfhocail go heisiach"

msgid ""
"When enabled, passes --keyword without a value to xgettext before the "
"additional keyword, disabling all default keywords so that only the keyword "
"specified above is recognized."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn sé cumasaithe, cuirtear --keyword gan luach chuig xgettext "
"roimh an eochairfhocal breise, rud a dhíchumasaíonn na heochairfhocail "
"réamhshocraithe go léir ionas nach n-aithnítear ach an eochairfhocal atá "
"sonraithe thuas."

msgid "This field is required."
msgstr "Tá an réimse seo riachtanach."

msgid "An additional keyword is required when using keywords exclusively."
msgstr ""
"Tá eochairfhocal breise ag teastáil nuair a úsáidtear eochairfhocail amháin."

msgid "Input source"
msgstr "Foinse ionchuir"

msgid "Source file patterns"
msgstr "Patrúin comhaid foinse"

msgid "POTFILES manifest"
msgstr "Léiriú POTFILES"

msgid ""
"Choose whether xgettext should read source files from glob patterns or from "
"a POTFILES/POTFILES.in manifest."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an léifidh xgettext comhaid foinse ó phatrúin glob nó ó mhaitrís "
"POTFILES/POTFILES.in."

msgid "xgettext language"
msgstr "teanga xgettext"

msgid ""
"Programming language passed to xgettext, for example Python or C. Leave "
"blank to let xgettext guess the language from file extensions."
msgstr ""
"Teanga ríomhchlárúcháin a chuirtear chuig xgettext, mar shampla Python nó C. "
"Fág bán le ligean do xgettext buille faoi thuairim a thabhairt faoin teanga "
"ó shíntí comhaid."

msgid ""
"Newline-separated repository-relative glob patterns for files to extract "
"with xgettext."
msgstr ""
"Patrúin globa coibhneasta leis an stór atá scartha de réir líne nua le "
"haghaidh comhad le baint amach le xgettext."

msgid "POTFILES path"
msgstr "Cosán POTFILES"

msgid ""
"Repository-relative path to POTFILES or POTFILES.in. Entries are resolved "
"relative to the repository root. If present next to the manifest, "
"POTFILES.skip excludes listed files from extraction."
msgstr ""
"Cosán gaolmhar leis an stórlann chuig POTFILES nó POTFILES.in. Réitítear "
"iontrálacha i gcoibhneas le fréamh an stórlainne. Má tá sé i láthair in aice "
"leis an manifíse, ní dhéanann POTFILES.skip comhaid liostaithe a eastóscadh."

msgid "Invalid symbolic link in a repository."
msgstr "Nasc siombalach neamhbhailí i stórlann."

msgid "POTFILES path has to point to a file."
msgstr "Caithfidh cosán POTFILES pointeáil chuig comhad."

msgid "Meson preset"
msgstr "Réamhshocrú Meson"

msgid "GLib"
msgstr "GLib"

msgid ""
"Built-in xgettext argument preset matching Meson gettext integration. The "
"GLib preset adds the keyword and format-flag options used by Meson's gettext "
"helper."
msgstr ""
"Réamhshocrú argóinte xgettext ionsuite a mheaitseálann comhtháthú gettext "
"Meson. Cuireann an réamhshocrú GLib na roghanna eochairfhocail agus brataí "
"formáide a úsáideann cúntóir gettext Meson leis."

msgid ""
"The Meson add-on expects a Meson gettext directory with meson.build and "
"POTFILES or POTFILES.in."
msgstr ""
"Tá an breiseán Meson ag súil le heolaire gettext Meson le meson.build agus "
"POTFILES nó POTFILES.in."

msgid "The component has to define a gettext template for new translations."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh an chomhpháirt teimpléad gettext a shainiú le haghaidh "
"aistriúcháin nua."

msgid ""
"The Django add-on expects the template for new translations to be named "
"\"django.pot\", \"djangojs.pot\", \"django.po\", or \"djangojs.po\"."
msgstr ""
"Táthar ag súil leis sa bhreiseán Django go mbeidh teimpléad le haghaidh "
"aistriúcháin nua ainmnithe mar \"django.pot\", \"djangojs.pot\", "
"\"django.po\", nó \"djangojs.po\"."

msgid "Filtering"
msgstr "Scagadh"

msgctxt "None filtering"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Dada"

msgid "Weblate documentation"
msgstr "Cáipéisíocht Weblate"

msgid ""
"Optionally remove strings that are not useful to translate after Sphinx "
"extraction."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir teaghráin nach bhfuil úsáideach le haistriú a bhaint tar éis "
"eastóscadh an Sphinx, más mian leat."

msgid ""
"The Sphinx add-on expects the template for new translations to be a .pot "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Tá súil ag an mbreiseán Sphinx go mbeidh an teimpléad le haghaidh "
"aistriúcháin nua ina chomhad .pot."

msgid ""
"The Sphinx add-on expects the template for new translations to live in a "
"\"locales\" directory."
msgstr ""
"Tá súil ag an mbreiseán Sphinx go mbeidh an teimpléad le haghaidh "
"aistriúcháin nua suite in eolaire \"locales\"."

msgid "Could not determine Sphinx source directory."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir eolaire foinse Sphinx a chinneadh."

msgid "Name of generated file"
msgstr "Ainm an chomhaid a cruthaíodh"

msgid "Content of generated file"
msgstr "Ábhar an chomhaid a cruthaíodh"

msgid "Commit squashing"
msgstr "Tiomantas scuaise"

msgid "All commits into one"
msgstr "Gach tiomantas i amháin"

msgid "Per language"
msgstr "In aghaidh an teanga"

msgid "Per file"
msgstr "In aghaidh an chomhaid"

msgid "Per author"
msgstr "De réir an údair"

msgid "Append trailers to squashed commit message"
msgstr "Leantóirí a chur i gceangal leis an teachtaireacht cimithe brúite"

msgid ""
"Trailer lines are lines that look similar to RFC 822 e-mail headers, at the "
"end of the otherwise free-form part of a commit message, such as 'Co-"
"authored-by: …'."
msgstr ""
"Is éard atá i línte leantóir ná línte atá cosúil le ceanntásca r-phoist RFC "
"822, ag deireadh na coda eile de theachtaireacht gealltanais, amhail ‘Co-"
"authored-by: …’."

msgid "Commit message"
msgstr "Tiomantas teachtaireacht"

msgid ""
"This commit message will be used instead of the combined commit messages "
"from the squashed commits."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidfear an teachtaireacht gealltanais seo in ionad na dteachtaireachtaí "
"comhcheangailte ón ngealltanas brúite."

msgid "Days to keep"
msgstr "Laethanta le coinneáil"

msgid "Voting threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach vótála"

msgid ""
"Threshold for removal. Leave empty to remove suggestions regardless of "
"votes. This field has no effect with voting turned off."
msgstr ""
"Tairseach le haghaidh bainte. Fág folamh chun moltaí a bhaint beag beann ar "
"vótaí. Níl aon éifeacht ag an réimse seo nuair a bhíonn an vótáil múchta."

msgid "I confirm the above actions look correct"
msgstr "Deimhním go bhfuil cuma cheart ar na gníomhartha thuas"

msgid "Please review and confirm the missing language changes."
msgstr "Athbhreithnigh agus deimhnigh na hathruithe teanga atá ar iarraidh."

msgid "Regular expression to match translation files against"
msgstr "slonn rialta chun comhaid aistriúcháin a mheaitseáil le"

msgid ""
"The regular expression must define named groups for component and language."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh an abairt rialta grúpaí ainmnithe a shainiú don chomhpháirt agus "
"don teanga."

msgid "File format"
msgstr "Formáid comhaid"

msgid "Customize the component name"
msgstr "Saincheap ainm an chomhpháirt"

msgid "Use Django template syntax. This template must include {{ component }}."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as comhréir teimpléid Django. Ní mór {{ component }} a bheith san "
"áireamh sa teimpléad seo."

msgid "Define the monolingual base filename"
msgstr "Sainmhínigh an bonnainm aonteangach"

msgid ""
"Leave empty for bilingual translation files. When set, this template must "
"include {{ component }}."
msgstr ""
"Fág folamh le haghaidh comhaid aistriúcháin dátheangacha. Nuair a bheidh sé "
"socraithe, ní mór {{ component }} a bheith san áireamh sa teimpléad seo."

msgid "Define the base file for new translations"
msgstr "Sainmhínigh an bunchomhad le haghaidh aistriúcháin nua"

msgid ""
"Filename of file used for creating new translations. For gettext choose .pot "
"file. This template must include {{ component }}."
msgstr ""
"Ainm comhaid an chomhaid a úsáidtear chun aistriúcháin nua a chruthú. "
"Roghnaigh comhad .pot le haghaidh gettext. Caithfidh {{ component }} a "
"bheith sa teimpléad seo."

msgid "Intermediate language file"
msgstr "Comhad teanga idirmheánach"

msgid ""
"Filename of intermediate translation file. In most cases this is a "
"translation file provided by developers and is used when creating actual "
"source strings. This template must include {{ component }}."
msgstr ""
"Ainm comhaid an chomhaid aistriúcháin idirmheánaigh. I bhformhór na "
"gcásanna, is comhad aistriúcháin é seo arna sholáthar ag forbróirí agus "
"úsáidtear é agus teaghráin foinse iarbhír á gcruthú. Ní mór {{ component }} "
"a bheith san áireamh sa teimpléad seo."

msgid "Language filter"
msgstr "Scagaire teanga"

msgid ""
"Regular expression to filter translation files against when scanning for "
"file mask."
msgstr ""
"Slonn rialta chun comhaid aistriúcháin a scagadh ina choinne agus masc "
"comhaid á scanadh."

msgid "Clone add-ons from the main component to the newly created ones"
msgstr "Breiseáin Clón ón bpríomh-chomhpháirt go dtí na cinn nuachruthaithe"

msgid "Remove components for inexistent files"
msgstr "Bain comhpháirteanna as comhaid nach bhfuil ann"

msgid "I confirm the above matches look correct"
msgstr "Deimhním go bhfuil cuma cheart ar na cluichí thuas"

#, python-format
msgid "Generic preset: %(name)s [%(details)s]"
msgstr "Réamhshocrú ginearálta: %(name)s [%(details)s]"

msgid "format not preset"
msgstr "formáid gan réamhshocrú"

#, python-format
msgid "monolingual base: %(base)s"
msgstr "bonn aonteangach: %(base)s"

msgid "no monolingual base"
msgstr "gan aon bhonn aonteangach"

#, python-format
msgid "%(format)s; %(base)s"
msgstr "%(format)s; %(base)s"

msgid "One folder per language"
msgstr "Fillteán amháin in aghaidh na teanga"

msgid "Matches files like cs/application.po."
msgstr "Meaitseálann sé comhaid cosúil le cs/application.po."

msgid "Gettext locales layout"
msgstr "Leagan amach locales Gettext"

msgid "Matches files like locale/cs/LC_MESSAGES/application.po."
msgstr ""
"Meaitseálann sé comhaid cosúil le locale/cs/LC_MESSAGES/application.po."

msgid "Complex filenames"
msgstr "Ainmneacha comhaid casta"

msgid "Matches files like src/locale/application.cs.po."
msgstr "Meaitseálann sé comhaid cosúil le src/locale/application.cs.po."

msgid "Filename-based language variants"
msgstr "Malartacha teanga bunaithe ar ainm comhaid"

msgid "Matches files like news_en.md."
msgstr "Meaitseálann sé comhaid cosúil le news_en.md."

msgid "Repeated language code"
msgstr "Cód teanga arís agus arís eile"

msgid "Matches files like locale/cs/application/cs.po."
msgstr "Meaitseálann sé comhaid cosúil le locale/cs/application/cs.po."

msgid "Split Android strings"
msgstr "Scoilt teaghráin Android"

msgid "Matches files like res/values-cs/strings-about.xml."
msgstr "Meaitseálann sé comhaid cosúil le res/values-cs/strings-about.xml."

msgid "Matching multiple paths"
msgstr "Cosáin iolracha a mheaitseáil"

msgid ""
"Matches nested Java properties layouts and also fills the component name "
"template."
msgstr ""
"Meaitseálann sé leagan amach airíonna Java neadaithe agus líonann sé "
"teimpléad ainm an chomhpháirte freisin."

#, python-format
msgid "Detected: %(pattern)s [%(details)s]"
msgstr "Braiteadh: %(pattern)s [%(details)s]"

msgid "Detected from repository"
msgstr "Braite ón stórlann"

msgid "Generic presets"
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe ginearálta"

msgid "You can not use a monolingual translation without a base file."
msgstr "Ní féidir leat aistriúchán aonteangach a úsáid gan bunchomhad."

msgid "You can not use a base file for bilingual translation."
msgstr "Ní féidir leat bunchomhad a úsáid le haghaidh aistriúchán dátheangach."

msgid "Please review and confirm the matched components."
msgstr "Déan athbhreithniú agus deimhnigh na comhpháirteanna meaitseáilte."

msgid "This template must include {{ component }}."
msgstr "Ní mór {{ component }} a bheith san áireamh sa teimpléad seo."

msgid "This template must include component markup."
msgstr "Ní mór marcáil chomhpháirte a bheith san áireamh sa teimpléad seo."

msgid "Translation threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach aistriúcháin"

msgid ""
"The percentage of translated strings that must be present for translation to "
"be included."
msgstr ""
"An céatadán de theaghráin aistrithe nach mór a bheith i láthair le go "
"gcuirfear aistriúchán san áireamh."

msgid "CSS selector"
msgstr "Roghnóir CSS"

msgid "CSS selector to detect localizable elements."
msgstr "Roghnóir CSS chun eilimintí logánta a bhrath."

msgid "Language cookie name"
msgstr "Ainm fianán teanga"

msgid "Name of cookie which stores language preference."
msgstr "Ainm an fhianáin a stórálann rogha teanga."

msgid "Extract strings from HTML files"
msgstr "Sliocht teaghráin ó chomhaid HTML"

msgid ""
"List of filenames in current repository or remote URLs to parse for "
"translatable strings."
msgstr ""
"Liosta de na comhaid sa stór reatha nó i URLanna cianda le parsáil le "
"haghaidh teaghráin inaistrithe."

#, python-format
msgid "Could not parse CSS selector: %s"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir roghnóir CSS a pharsáil: %s"

msgid "Source strings"
msgstr "Teaghráin foinse"

msgid "Target translation"
msgstr "Aistriúchán sprice"

msgid "All strings in this translation will be overwritten"
msgstr "Déanfar gach teaghrán san aistriúchán seo a fhorscríobh"

msgid "Prepended static text"
msgstr "Téacs statach curtha roimh"

msgid "Prepended variable text"
msgstr "Téacs athrógach curtha roimh"

msgid "Appended static text"
msgstr "Téacs statach curtha leis"

msgid "Appended variable text"
msgstr "Téacs athraitheach curtha leis"

msgid "Variable text multiplier"
msgstr "Iolraitheoir téacs athraitheach"

msgid ""
"How many times to repeat the variable text depending on the length of the "
"source string."
msgstr ""
"Cé mhéad uair is ceart an téacs athrógach a athdhéanamh ag brath ar fhad an "
"teaghráin foinse."

msgid "Include read-only strings"
msgstr "Cuir teaghráin inléite amháin san áireamh"

msgid "The source and target have to be different languages."
msgstr "Caithfidh gur teangacha éagsúla an fhoinse agus an sprioc."

msgid "Enable case-sensitive key sorting"
msgstr "Cumasaigh sórtáil eochrach cás-íogair"

msgid "Change events to trigger"
msgstr "Athraigh imeachtaí le spreagadh"

msgid "Translation content events"
msgstr "Imeachtaí ábhair aistriúcháin"

msgid "All change events"
msgstr "Gach imeacht athraithe"

msgid "Selected change events"
msgstr "Imeachtaí athraithe roghnaithe"

msgid "Choose which change events should trigger this add-on."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cé na himeachtaí athraithe ba chóir a chur i ngníomh an breiseáin "
"seo."

msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "URL Webhook"

msgid "Webhook secret"
msgstr "Rún Webhook"

msgid "The Standard Webhooks secret is a base64 encoded string."
msgstr "Is teaghrán ionchódaithe base64 é rún Standard Webhooks."

msgid "AMQP broker URL"
msgstr "URL bróicéir AMQP"

msgid "The AMQP broker URL to connect to."
msgstr "URL an bhróicéara AMQP le ceangal leis."

msgid "Topic prefix"
msgstr "Réimír na topaice"

msgid "Optional prefix to prepend to generated message topics."
msgstr "Réimír roghnach le cur le topaicí teachtaireachtaí ginte."

msgid "CA certificate bundle (PEM)"
msgstr "Pacáiste deimhnithe CA (PEM)"

msgid ""
"Paste only PEM certificate blocks, each starting with \"-----BEGIN "
"CERTIFICATE-----\" and ending with \"-----END CERTIFICATE-----\"."
msgstr ""
"Greamaigh bloic teastais PEM amháin, gach ceann acu ag tosú le \"-----BEGIN "
"CERTIFICATE-----\" agus ag críochnú le \"-----END CERTIFICATE-----\"."

msgid "Client private key (PEM)"
msgstr "Eochair phríobháideach an chliaint (PEM)"

msgid ""
"Paste a single unencrypted PEM private key block. Encrypted private keys are "
"not supported."
msgstr ""
"Greamaigh bloc eochrach príobháideach PEM neamhchriptithe amháin. Ní "
"thacaítear le heochracha príobháideacha criptithe."

msgid "Client certificate (PEM)"
msgstr "Teastas cliant (PEM)"

msgid ""
"Paste only the PEM certificate block starting with \"-----BEGIN "
"CERTIFICATE-----\"; do not paste the output from \"openssl x509 -text\"."
msgstr ""
"Greamaigh an bloc deimhnithe PEM amháin ag tosú le \"-----BEGIN "
"CERTIFICATE-----\"; ná greamaigh an t-aschur ó \"openssl x509 -text\"."

msgid "Publish timeout"
msgstr "Am críochnaithe foilsitheoireachta"

msgid "How many seconds to wait for the broker delivery acknowledgement."
msgstr "Cé mhéad soicind le fanacht ar admháil seachadta an bhróicéara."

msgid "Connection attempts"
msgstr "Iarrachtaí ceangail"

msgid "How many times to try connecting to the broker."
msgstr "Cé mhéad uair is ceart iarracht a dhéanamh ceangal leis an mbróicéir."

msgid "Retry delay"
msgstr "Moill athiarrachta"

msgid "How many seconds to wait between connection attempts."
msgstr "Cé mhéad soicind le fanacht idir iarrachtaí ceangail."

msgid "Topic prefix can contain only ASCII characters."
msgstr "Ní féidir ach carachtair ASCII a bheith sa réimír topaice."

#, python-format
msgid "Topic prefix must not exceed %(limit)d characters."
msgstr "Ní féidir réimír an ábhair a bheith níos mó ná %(limit)d carachtar."

msgid "The SSL certificates have to be provided for SSL connection."
msgstr "Caithfear na deimhnithe SSL a sholáthar le haghaidh nasc SSL."

msgid "The SSL certificates are not used without a SSL connection."
msgstr "Ní úsáidtear na deimhnithe SSL gan nasc SSL."

msgid "Statistics generator"
msgstr "Gineadóir staitisticí"

msgid "Generates a file containing detailed info about the translation status."
msgstr ""
"Gintear comhad ina bhfuil faisnéis mhionsonraithe faoi stádas an "
"aistriúcháin."

msgid "Pseudolocale generation"
msgstr "Giniúint pseudolocale"

msgid ""
"Generates a translation by adding prefix and suffix to source strings "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Gintear aistriúchán trí réimír agus iarmhír a chur le teaghráin foinse go "
"huathoibríoch."

msgid "Prefill translation with source"
msgstr "Réamhlíon an t-aistriúchán leis an bhfoinse"

msgid "Fills in translation strings with source string."
msgstr "Líonann sé teaghráin aistriúcháin le teaghrán foinse."

msgid "Fill read-only strings with source"
msgstr "Líon teaghráin inléite amháin leis an bhfoinse"

msgid "Fills in translation of read-only strings with source string."
msgstr "Líonann sé aistriúchán teaghráin inléite amháin le teaghrán foinse."

msgid "Generate MO files"
msgstr "Gin comhaid MO"

msgid "Automatically generates a MO file for every changed PO file."
msgstr "Gineann sé go huathoibríoch comhad MO do gach comhad PO athraithe."

msgid "Update LINGUAS file"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh comhad LINGUAS"

msgid "Updates the LINGUAS file when a translation is added or removed."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíonn sé an comhad LINGUAS nuair a chuirtear aistriúchán leis nó "
"nuair a bhaintear é."

msgid "Update ALL_LINGUAS variable in the \"configure\" file"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh ALL_LINGUAS athróg sa chomhad \"cumraigh\""

msgid ""
"Updates the ALL_LINGUAS variable in \"configure\", \"configure.in\" or "
"\"configure.ac\" files, when a translation is added or removed."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíonn sé an athróg ALL_LINGUAS i gcomhaid \"configure\", "
"\"configure.in\" nó \"configure.ac\", nuair a chuirtear aistriúchán leis nó "
"nuair a bhaintear é."

msgid "Update PO files to match POT (msgmerge)"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh comhaid PO chun teacht le POT (msgmerge)"

msgid ""
"Updates all PO files (as configured by \"File mask\") to match the POT file "
"(as configured by \"Template for new translations\") using msgmerge."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraítear gach comhad PO (mar atá cumraithe ag \"Masc Comhaid\") chun "
"an comhad POT a mheaitseáil (mar atá cumraithe ag \"Teimpléad le haghaidh "
"aistriúcháin nua\") ag baint úsáide as msgmerge."

msgid "Update POT file (xgettext)"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh comhad POT (xgettext)"

msgid "Updates the gettext template using xgettext on selected source files."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíonn sé an teimpléad gettext ag baint úsáide as xgettext ar "
"chomhaid foinse roghnaithe."

msgid "Update POT file (Meson)"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh comhad POT (Meson)"

msgid "Updates the gettext template using Meson gettext conventions."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíonn sé an teimpléad gettext ag baint úsáide as coinbhinsiúin "
"gettext Meson."

msgid "Update gettext template (Django)"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh teimpléad gettext (Django)"

msgid ""
"Updates the gettext template using Django's built-in makemessages command."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíonn sé an teimpléad gettext ag baint úsáide as an ordú "
"makemessages atá ionsuite i Django."

msgid "Update POT file (Sphinx)"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh comhad POT (Sphinx)"

msgid ""
"Updates the gettext template using Sphinx's gettext builder without loading "
"project configuration."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíonn sé an teimpléad gettext ag baint úsáide as tógálaí gettext "
"Sphinx gan cumraíocht an tionscadail a luchtú."

msgid "Contributors in comment"
msgstr "Rannpháirtithe sa trácht"

msgid ""
"Updates the comment part of the PO file header to include contributor names "
"and years of contributions."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraítear an chuid tuairimí de cheanntásc an chomhaid PO chun "
"ainmneacha ranníocóirí agus blianta na ranníocaíochtaí a áireamh."

msgid "Squash Git commits"
msgstr "Geallann Squash Git"

msgid "Squash Git commits prior to pushing changes."
msgstr "Geallann Squash Git roimh athruithe a bhrú."

msgid "This add-on cannot be triggered manually."
msgstr "Ní féidir an breiseán seo a ghníomhachtú de láimh."

msgid "Format the Java properties file"
msgstr "Formáidigh an comhad airíonna Java"

msgid "Formats and sorts the Java properties file."
msgstr "Formáidí agus sórtálann an comhad airíonna Java."

msgid "Stale comment removal"
msgstr "Baint tráchta stale"

msgid "Set a timeframe for removal of comments."
msgstr "Socraigh fráma ama chun tuairimí a bhaint."

msgid "Stale suggestion removal"
msgstr "Moladh stale a bhaint"

msgid "Set a timeframe for removal of suggestions."
msgstr "Socraigh fráma ama chun moltaí a bhaint."

msgid "Update RESX files"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh comhaid RESX"

msgid ""
"Update all translation files to match the monolingual upstream base file. "
"Unused strings are removed, and new ones added as copies of the source "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraigh gach comhad aistriúcháin chun teacht leis an mbunchomhad "
"aonteangach réamhtheachtacha. Baintear teaghráin nár úsáideadh, agus "
"cuirtear cinn nua leis mar chóipeanna den teaghrán foinse."

msgid "site-wide add-ons"
msgstr "breiseáin ar fud an tsuímh"

msgctxt "Add-on scope"
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "Stór"

msgctxt "Add-on scope"
msgid "Component"
msgstr "Comhpháirt"

msgctxt "Add-on scope"
msgid "Parent category"
msgstr "Catagóir tuismitheora"

msgctxt "Add-on scope"
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Catagóir"

msgctxt "Add-on scope"
msgid "Project"
msgstr "Tionscadal"

msgctxt "Add-on scope"
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Áit"

#, python-format
msgid "Invalid add-on name: ”%s”"
msgstr "Ainm an bhreiseáin neamhbhailí: ”%s”"

#, python-format
msgid "Add-on cannot be installed: ”%s”"
msgstr "Ní féidir an breiseán a shuiteáil: “%s”"

msgid "Add-on installed, please review integration instructions."
msgstr "Suiteáilte an breiseán, athbhreithnigh na treoracha comhtháthaithe."

msgid "Add-on run has been scheduled."
msgstr "Tá rith breiseáin sceidealaithe."

msgid "Webhook"
msgstr "Crúca Gréasáin"

msgid ""
"Sends notifications to external services based on selected events, following "
"the Standard Webhooks specification."
msgstr ""
"Seolann sé fógraí chuig seirbhísí seachtracha bunaithe ar imeachtaí "
"roghnaithe, ag leanúint shonraíocht chaighdeánach Webhooks."

msgid "Slack Webhooks"
msgstr "Crúcaí Gréasáin Slack"

msgid "Sends notification to a Slack channel based on selected events."
msgstr "Seolann sé fógra chuig cainéal Slack bunaithe ar imeachtaí roghnaithe."

msgid "Session-based authentication used when user is signed in."
msgstr ""
"Fíordheimhniú bunaithe ar sheisiún a úsáidtear nuair atá an t-úsáideoir "
"sínithe isteach."

#, python-format
msgid "Token-based authentication with required prefix `%s`."
msgstr "Fíordheimhniú comhartha-bhunaithe leis an réimír riachtanach `%s`."

msgid ""
"Each user has a personal access token which they can get from their "
"respective user profile. These tokens have the `wlu_` prefix."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhartha rochtana pearsanta ag gach úsáideoir ar féidir leo a fháil óna "
"bpróifíl úsáideora faoi seach. Tá an réimír `wlu_` ag na comharthaí seo."

msgid ""
"It is possible to create project tokens whose access to the API is limited "
"to operations to their associated project. These tokens have the `wlp_` "
"prefix."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir comharthaí tionscadail a chruthú a bhfuil rochtain ar an API "
"teoranta d'oibríochtaí dá dtionscadal gaolmhar. Tá an réimír `wlp_` ag na "
"comharthaí seo."

msgid "Successful response."
msgstr "Freagra rathúil."

msgid "The resource was created."
msgstr "Cruthaíodh an acmhainn."

msgid "The request was accepted for asynchronous processing."
msgstr "Glacadh leis an iarratas le haghaidh próiseála neamhshioncrónaigh."

msgid "Successful response without a response body."
msgstr "Freagra rathúil gan chorp freagartha."

msgid "The request was invalid or could not be parsed."
msgstr "Bhí an iarratas neamhbhailí nó níorbh fhéidir é a pharsáil."

msgid "Authentication credentials were missing or invalid."
msgstr "Bhí dintiúir fíordheimhnithe ar iarraidh nó neamhbhailí."

msgid "The authenticated user does not have permission for this operation."
msgstr "Níl cead ag an úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe don oibríocht seo."

msgid "The requested resource was not found or is not accessible."
msgstr "Níor aimsíodh an acmhainn iarrtha nó níl rochtain uirthi."

msgid "The HTTP method is not allowed for this resource."
msgstr "Ní cheadaítear an modh HTTP don acmhainn seo."

msgid "The requested response media type is not available."
msgstr "Níl an cineál meán freagartha iarrtha ar fáil."

msgid "The request media type is not supported."
msgstr "Ní thacaítear leis an gcineál meán iarrata."

msgid "The resource is locked."
msgstr "Tá an acmhainn faoi ghlas."

msgid "The API request rate limit was exceeded."
msgstr "Sáraíodh teorainn ráta iarratais API."

msgid "An unexpected server error occurred."
msgstr "Tharla earráid freastalaí gan choinne."

msgid ""
"Filter by change action. Repeat this parameter to filter by multiple actions."
msgstr ""
"Scag de réir gníomh athraithe. Déan an paraiméadar seo arís chun scagadh a "
"dhéanamh de réir ilghníomhartha."

msgid "Allowed number of requests to perform"
msgstr "Líon iarratas ceadaithe a dhéanamh"

msgid "Remaining number of requests to perform"
msgstr "An líon iarratas atá fágtha le déanamh"

msgid "Number of seconds until the rate-limit window resets"
msgstr "Líon soicind go dtí go n-athshocraíonn an fhuinneog teorainn ráta"

msgid "Invalid component path."
msgstr "Cosán comhpháirte neamhbhailí."

msgid "URL slug"
msgstr "Sluga URL"

msgid "Name used in URLs and filenames."
msgstr "Ainm a úsáidtear i URLanna agus i gcomhainmneacha."

msgid "Required for credits, contributor stats, and translator work reports."
msgstr ""
"Riachtanach le haghaidh creidiúintí, staitisticí rannpháirtíthe, agus "
"tuarascálacha oibre aistritheoirí."

msgid "Invalid workspace."
msgstr "Spás oibre neamhbhailí."

msgid "Invalid project."
msgstr "Tionscadal neamhbhailí."

msgid "Invalid category."
msgstr "Catagóir neamhbhailí."

msgid "Do not specify a scope on a scoped reports endpoint."
msgstr "Ná sonraigh raon feidhme ar chríochphointe tuarascálacha raonta."

msgid "Choose at most one report scope."
msgstr "Roghnaigh raon feidhme tuarascála amháin ar a mhéad."

msgid "Start and end timestamps are required."
msgstr "Tá stampaí ama tosaigh agus deiridh ag teastáil."

msgid "The report start must be before its end."
msgstr "Ní mór tús na tuarascála a bheith roimh a deireadh."

msgid "Minimum changes can not exceed maximum changes."
msgstr "Ní féidir leis na hathruithe íosta dul thar na hathruithe uasta."

msgid "This e-mail address has not been verified."
msgstr "Níl an seoladh ríomhphoist seo fíoraithe."

msgid "Scope"
msgstr "Raon feidhme"

msgid ""
"Is your comment specific to this translation, or generic for all of them?"
msgstr ""
"An mbaineann do thuairim go sonrach leis an aistriúchán seo, nó an cineálach "
"do gach ceann acu?"

msgid "Comment text"
msgstr "Téacs tráchta"

msgid "You can use Markdown and mention users by @username."
msgstr "Is féidir leat Markdown a úsáid agus úsáideoirí a lua le @username."

msgid "Creation timestamp"
msgstr "Stampa ama cruthaithe"

msgid ""
"If you’re an admin, you can set the explicit timestamp at which the comment "
"was created."
msgstr ""
"Más riarthóir thú, is féidir leat an stampa ama sainráite a shocrú ag a "
"cruthaíodh an trácht."

msgid "Commenter’s email"
msgstr "Ríomhphost an tráchtaire"

msgid ""
"If you’re an admin, you can attribute this comment to another user by their "
"email."
msgstr ""
"Más riarthóir thú, is féidir leat an trácht seo a chur i leith úsáideora "
"eile trína ríomhphost."

msgid "Cannot change this on a built-in team."
msgstr "Ní féidir é seo a athrú ar fhoireann ionsuite."

msgid "Cannot change this on an existing team."
msgstr "Ní féidir é seo a athrú ar fhoireann atá ann cheana féin."

msgid "Choose either a project or a workspace."
msgstr "Roghnaigh tionscadal nó spás oibre."

msgid "A team with this name already exists in this workspace."
msgstr "Tá foireann leis an ainm seo ann cheana féin sa spás oibre seo."

msgid "Cannot change this on a scoped team."
msgstr "Ní féidir é seo a athrú ar fhoireann raon feidhme."

msgid "You do not have permission to access this component."
msgstr "Níl cead agat an chomhpháirt seo a rochtain."

msgid "You do not have permission to change restricted access."
msgstr "Níl cead agat rochtain srianta a athrú."

msgid "Commit"
msgstr "Geall"

msgid "Update"
msgstr "Nuashonrú"

msgid "Update with rebase"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh le rebase"

msgid "Update with merge"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh le cumasc"

msgid "Update with merge without fast-forward"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh le cumasc gan tapa ar aghaidh"

msgid "Push"
msgstr "Brúigh"

msgid "Reset all changes in the Weblate repository"
msgstr "Athshocraigh gach athrú sa stór Weblate"

msgid "Reset the Weblate repository and reapply translations"
msgstr "Athshocraigh stórlann Weblate agus cuir aistriúcháin i bhfeidhm arís"

msgid "Cleanup all untracked files in the Weblate repository"
msgstr "Glantar gach comhad neamhrianaithe i stór Weblate"

msgid "Force writing all translations to the Weblate repository"
msgstr "Cuir iallach ar gach aistriúchán a scríobh chuig an stór Weblate"

msgid "Rescan all translation files in the Weblate repository"
msgstr "Athscan gach comhad aistriúcháin sa stór Weblate"

msgid "Please provide a suggestion"
msgstr "Tabhair moladh le do thoil"

msgid "Translation text too long!"
msgstr "Téacs aistriúcháin rófhada!"

msgid "Number of plurals does not match"
msgstr "Ní hionann líon na n-iolraí"

msgid "Your suggestion is similar to the current translation!"
msgstr "Tá do mholadh cosúil leis an aistriúchán reatha!"

msgid "Your suggestion already exists!"
msgstr "Tá do mholadh ann cheana féin!"

msgid "Weblate's REST API"
msgstr "API REST Weblate"

msgid ""
"Could not remove the string because another background operation is in "
"progress. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an teaghrán a bhaint mar go bhfuil oibríocht chúlra eile ar "
"siúl. Déan iarracht arís ar ball."

msgid "Could not obtain the lock to perform the operation."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an glas a fháil chun an oibríocht a dhéanamh."

msgid "Specified unit id is not a translation source unit."
msgstr "Ní aonad foinse aistriúcháin é an t-aitheantas aonaid sonraithe."

#, python-format
msgid "Could not obtain the repository lock for %s to perform the operation."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir glas an taisclainne a fháil le haghaidh %s chun an oibríocht "
"a dhéanamh."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Could not obtain the update lock for component %s to perform the operation."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an glas nuashonraithe a fháil do chomhpháirt %s chun an "
"oibríocht a dhéanamh."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Could not obtain the %(scope)s lock for %(origin)s to perform the operation."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir glas %(scope)s a fháil le haghaidh %(origin)s chun an "
"oibríocht a dhéanamh."

msgid "Expected an object."
msgstr "Bhíothas ag súil le réad."

msgid "At least one team is required for a project token."
msgstr ""
"Tá foireann amháin ar a laghad ag teastáil le haghaidh comhartha tionscadail."

msgid "This role cannot be assigned to this team."
msgstr "Ní féidir an ról seo a shannadh don fhoireann seo."

msgid "Cannot change languages on a workspace team."
msgstr "Ní féidir teangacha a athrú ar fhoireann spás oibre."

msgid "Cannot change projects on a scoped team."
msgstr "Ní féidir tionscadail a athrú ar fhoireann raon feidhme."

msgid "Cannot change component lists on a scoped team."
msgstr "Ní féidir liostaí comhpháirteanna a athrú ar fhoireann raon feidhme."

msgid "Cannot change components on a workspace team."
msgstr "Ní féidir comhpháirteanna a athrú ar fhoireann spás oibre."

