msgstr "Riarthóirí foirne"

msgid "The administrator can add or remove users from a team."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an riarthóir úsáideoirí a chur leis nó a bhaint de fhoireann."

msgid "Enforced two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Fíordheimhniú dhá fhachtóir curtha i bhfeidhm"

msgid "Requires users to have two-factor authentication configured."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn sé go mbeidh fíordheimhniú dhá fhachtóir cumraithe ag úsáideoirí."

msgid "Team can be scoped either to a project or to a workspace."
msgstr "Is féidir foireann a cheangal le tionscadal nó le spás oibre."

msgid "Limit languages"
msgstr "Teorainn a chur le teangacha"

msgid ""
"Limit permissions from this team to these languages. Project-wide, component-"
"wide and global permissions from this team are not granted when a language "
"limit is set. Empty selection uses the team language selection without "
"additional limit."
msgstr ""
"Teorainnigh ceadanna ón bhfoireann seo do na teangacha seo. Ní dheonaítear "
"ceadanna ar fud an tionscadail, ar fud na comhpháirte ná ar fud na cruinne "
"ón bhfoireann seo nuair a shocraítear teorainn teanga. Úsáideann rogha "
"folamh rogha teanga na foirne gan teorainn bhreise."

#, python-format
msgid "Internal bot e-mail address is too long: %s"
msgstr "Tá seoladh ríomhphoist an bhota inmheánaigh rófhada: %s"

msgid ""
"Username may only contain letters, numbers or the following characters: @ . "
"+ - _"
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir ach litreacha, uimhreacha nó na carachtair seo a leanas a bheith "
"san ainm úsáideora: @ . + - _"

msgid "A user with that username already exists."
msgstr "Tá úsáideoir leis an ainm úsáideora sin ann cheana."

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Gníomhach"

msgid "Mark user as inactive instead of removing."
msgstr "Marcáil an t-úsáideoir mar neamhghníomhach seachas é a bhaint."

msgid "Expires"
msgstr "Téigh in éag"

msgid "The account will be disabled after the expiry."
msgstr "Díchumasófar an cuntas tar éis don dáta dul in éag."

msgid "Teams"
msgstr "Foirne"

msgid ""
"The user is granted all permissions included in membership of these teams."
msgstr ""
"Tugtar gach cead atá san áireamh i mballraíocht na bhfoirne seo don "
"úsáideoir."

msgid "Regular expression for e-mail address"
msgstr "Slonn rialta le haghaidh seoladh r-phoist"

msgid "Users with e-mail addresses found to match will be added to this team."
msgstr ""
"Cuirfear úsáideoirí a bhfuil seoltaí r-phoist acu a aimsítear a bhí ag "
"teacht leis an bhfoireann seo."

msgid "Team to assign"
msgstr "Foireann le sannadh"

msgid "User to block"
msgstr "Úsáideoir chun bac a chur air"

msgid "Block expiry"
msgstr "Bloc éaga"

msgid "Block note"
msgstr "Nóta blocála"

msgid ""
"Internal notes regarding blocking the user that are not visible to the user."
msgstr ""
"Nótaí inmheánacha maidir le bac a chur ar an úsáideoir nach bhfuil le "
"feiceáil ag an úsáideoir."

msgid "User to add"
msgstr "Úsáideoir le cur leis"

msgid "Please type in an existing Weblate account name or e-mail address."
msgstr ""
"Clóscríobh isteach ainm chuntais Weblate reatha nó seoladh ríomhphoist."

msgid "Suggest username for the user. It can be changed later."
msgstr "Mol ainm úsáideora don úsáideoir. Is féidir é a athrú níos déanaí."

msgid "Suggest full name for the user. It can be changed later."
msgstr "Mol ainm iomlán don úsáideoir. Is féidir é a athrú níos déanaí."

msgid "You do not have permission to edit glossary entries."
msgstr "Níl cead agat iontrálacha glosaire a chur in eagar."

msgid "You do not have permission to add glossary entries."
msgstr "Níl cead agat iontrálacha gluaise a chur leis."

msgid "You do not have permission to delete glossary entries."
msgstr "Níl cead agat iontrálacha glosaire a scriosadh."

msgid "You do not have permission to upload glossary entries."
msgstr "Níl cead agat iontrálacha gluaise a uaslódáil."

msgid ""
"Only privileged users can edit strings directly in this language because of "
"its translation workflow. Add a suggestion instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir ach le húsáideoirí pribhléideacha teaghráin a chur in eagar go "
"díreach sa teanga seo mar gheall ar a sreabhadh oibre aistriúcháin. Cuir "
"moladh leis ina ionad."

msgid ""
"Only privileged users can edit strings directly in this language because of "
"its translation workflow. Ask a project administrator for access."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir ach le húsáideoirí pribhléideacha teaghráin a chur in eagar go "
"díreach sa teanga seo mar gheall ar a sreabhadh oibre aistriúcháin. Iarr "
"rochtain ar riarthóir tionscadail."

msgid "Can not perform this operation without an e-mail address."
msgstr "Ní féidir an oibríocht seo a dhéanamh gan seoladh r-phoist."

msgid ""
"This project requires two-factor authentication; configure it in your "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú dhá fhachtóir ón tionscadal seo; cumraigh i do "
"phróifíl é."

msgid "This translation is currently locked."
msgstr "Tá an t-aistriúchán seo faoi ghlas faoi láthair."

msgid ""
"Contributing to this translation requires agreeing to its contributor "
"license agreement."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn aontú lena chomhaontú ceadúnais ranníocóra chun cur leis an "
"aistriúchán seo."

msgid "Sign in to save translations."
msgstr "Sínigh isteach chun aistriúcháin a shábháil."

msgid ""
"You do not have permission to approve translations in this restricted "
"component."
msgstr "Níl cead agat aistriúcháin a cheadú sa chomhpháirt srianta seo."

msgid ""
"You do not have permission to save translations in this restricted component."
msgstr "Níl cead agat aistriúcháin a shábháil sa chomhpháirt srianta seo."

msgid "You do not have permission to approve translations."
msgstr "Níl cead agat aistriúcháin a cheadú."

msgid "You do not have permission to save translations in this project."
msgstr "Níl cead agat aistriúcháin a shábháil sa tionscadal seo."

msgid "You do not have permission to edit source strings."
msgstr "Níl cead agat teaghráin foinse a chur in eagar."

msgid "Suggestion voting is disabled."
msgstr "Tá vótáil moltaí díchumasaithe."

msgid ""
"This translation is configured for suggestion voting. Add a suggestion "
"instead of saving a direct translation."
msgstr ""
"Tá an t-aistriúchán seo cumraithe le haghaidh vótáil moltaí. Cuir moladh "
"leis in ionad aistriúchán díreach a shábháil."

msgid "Pay the bills to unlock this project."
msgstr "Íoc na billí chun an tionscadal seo a dhíghlasáil."

msgid "The translation is read-only."
msgstr "Tá an t-aistriúchán inléite amháin."

msgid "Source-string reviews are turned off."
msgstr "Tá athbhreithnithe teaghrán foinse múchta."

msgid "Translation reviews are turned off."
msgstr "Tá léirmheasanna aistriúcháin múchta."

msgid "Reviewing is turned off."
msgstr "Tá athbhreithniú múchta."

msgid "The source string needs review."
msgstr "Ní mór athbhreithniú a dhéanamh ar an teaghrán foinse."

msgid "The string is read-only."
msgstr "Tá an teaghrán inléite amháin."

msgid ""
"Only reviewers can change approved strings. Please add a suggestion if you "
"think the string should be changed."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir ach le hathbhreithneoirí teaghráin cheadaithe a athrú. Cuir moladh "
"leis má cheapann tú gur cheart an teaghrán a athrú."

msgid "Add the string to the source language instead."
msgstr "Cuir an teaghrán leis an teanga foinse ina ionad sin."

msgid "Adding strings is disabled in the component configuration."
msgstr "Tá teaghráin curtha leis díchumasaithe i gcumraíocht an chomhpháirte."

msgid ""
"Cannot remove terminology translation. Remove the source string instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir aistriúchán téarmaíochta a bhaint. Bain an teaghrán foinse ina "
"ionad sin."

msgid "The file format does not support this."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn formáid an chomhaid leis seo."

msgid "Adding new translations is turned off in the component configuration."
msgstr "Múchadh aistriúcháin nua a chur leis i gcumraíocht an chomhpháirte."

msgid "This component is currently locked."
msgstr "Tá an chomhpháirt seo faoi ghlas faoi láthair."

msgid ""
"Suggestions are turned off for this language. Ask a project administrator to "
"enable them."
msgstr ""
"Tá moltaí múchta don teanga seo. Iarr ar riarthóir tionscadail iad a chumasú."

msgid "The file format does not support updating source strings."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn an fhormáid comhaid le teaghráin foinse a nuashonrú."

msgid ""
"Create the component and grant yourself explicit access before enabling "
