msgid "Locking prevents translators from doing changes."
msgstr "Cuireann glasáil cosc ar aistritheoirí athruithe a dhéanamh."

msgid "Reset and discard"
msgstr "Athshocraigh agus caith amach"

msgid ""
"Resets Weblate’s repository to match upstream and discards any pending "
"changes in Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Athshocraíonn sé stórlann Weblate chun meaitseáil suas an sruth agus "
"caitheann sé aon athruithe atá ar feitheamh i Weblate i leataobh."

msgid "Use when you want the upstream to be the authority for translations."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid nuair is mian leat go mbeadh an t-údarás uas-srutha le haghaidh "
"aistriúcháin."

msgid ""
"It will discard changes in Weblate repo and bring it in sync with the "
"upstream repository."
msgstr ""
"Caillfidh sé athruithe i stór Weblate agus cuirfidh sé i sioncrón é leis an "
"stór thuasluaite."

msgid "Reset and reapply"
msgstr "Athshocraigh agus cuir i bhfeidhm arís"

msgid ""
"Resets Weblate’s repository to match upstream and reapplies pending "
"translations onto the reset repository state."
msgstr ""
"Athshocraíonn sé stórlann Weblate chun go mbeidh sé in oiriúint don "
"réamhshruth agus cuireann sé aistriúcháin atá ar feitheamh i bhfeidhm arís "
"ar staid athshocraithe an stórlaigh."

msgid "Use when you want Weblate to be the authority for translations."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as nuair is mian leat go mbeadh Weblate mar údarás le haghaidh "
"aistriúcháin."

msgid ""
"Missing language files must already exist upstream or Weblate must be able "
"to create them for the component."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór comhaid teanga atá ar iarraidh a bheith ann cheana féin suas an sruth "
"nó ní mór do Weblate a bheith in ann iad a chruthú don chomhpháirt."

msgid "Cleanup"
msgstr "Glan Suas"

msgid ""
"Cleanup removes all files which are not tracked by the version control from "
"the repository."
msgstr ""
"Baineann glanta gach comhad nach bhfuil rianaithe ag an rialú leagan as an "
"stór."

msgid "It also removes stale branches which are not used by Weblate."
msgstr "Baineann sé freisin brainsí seanda nach n-úsáideann Weblate."

msgid "Use when there is some garbage left in the Weblate repository."
msgstr "Bain úsáid as nuair a bhíonn roinnt truflais fágtha i stór Weblate."

msgid "Synchronize"
msgstr "Sioncrónaigh"

msgid "Forces writing all strings to the translation files."
msgstr "Fórsaí ag scríobh gach teaghráin chuig na comhaid aistriúcháin."

msgid ""
"Use this when repository files became out of sync with Weblate for some "
"reason."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as seo nuair a d'éirigh comhaid stórtha as sioncronú le Weblate "
"ar chúis éigin."

msgid "Rescan"
msgstr "Athscanadh"

msgid "Loads translations from the files into Weblate."
msgstr "Luchtaíonn sé aistriúcháin ó na comhaid go Weblate."

msgid ""
"Use when Weblate missed some of the strings after updating the repository."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as nuair a chaill Weblate roinnt de na teaghráin tar éis an stór "
"a nuashonrú."

msgid ""
"This might discard edits that cannot be committed because of the configured "
"commit policy."
msgstr ""
"D’fhéadfadh sé seo athruithe nach féidir a chur i gcrích mar gheall ar an "
"mbeartas tiomantais cumraithe a chaitheamh amach."

msgid "Use these operations with caution, they can lead to data loss."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as na hoibríochtaí seo go cúramach, is féidir go dtiocfadh "
"caillteanas sonraí orthu."

msgid "File management"
msgstr "Bainistíocht comhad"

msgid "Remove duplicates"
msgstr "Bain dúblaigh"

msgid "Remove duplicated strings from the translation file"
msgstr "Bain teaghráin dhúblacha as an gcomhad aistriúcháin"

msgid ""
"Removes repeated strings with the same identifier from the translation file."
msgstr ""
"Baintear teaghráin athuair leis an aitheantóir céanna as an gcomhad "
"aistriúcháin."

msgid ""
"Use when the translation file contains duplicate strings that are not "
"present in Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid nuair a bhíonn teaghráin dhúblacha sa chomhad aistriúcháin nach bhfuil "
"i láthair i Weblate."

msgid "Cleanup unused"
msgstr "Glanadh neamhúsáidte"

msgid "Remove unused strings from the translation file"
msgstr "Bain teaghráin neamhúsáidte as an gcomhad aistriúcháin"

msgid "Removes strings that are no longer present in the base file."
msgstr "Baintear teaghráin nach bhfuil i láthair sa chomhad bonn a thuilleadh."

msgid "The cleanup translation files add-on can perform this automatically."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an mbreiseán glantacháin comhad aistriúcháin é seo a dhéanamh "
"go huathoibríoch."

msgid "Remove obsolete"
msgstr "Bain as dáta"

msgid "Remove obsolete strings from the translation file"
msgstr "Bain teaghráin atá as dáta ón gcomhad aistriúcháin"

msgid "Removes obsolete strings from PO files."
msgstr "Baintear teaghráin atá as dáta as comhaid PO."

msgid ""
"Use when obsolete entries should be pruned without enabling automatic "
"removal on save."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid é nuair is gá iontrálacha atá as dáta a bhearradh gan baint "
"uathoibríoch a chumasú le linn sábháil."

msgid "Use these operations with caution, they rewrite the translation file."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as na hoibríochtaí seo go cúramach, athscríobhann siad an comhad "
"aistriúcháin."

