msgstr "Cuntas GitHub ceangailte nuashonraithe."

msgid ""
"The Weblate GitHub app installation link is no longer valid. Start the "
"installation again."
msgstr ""
"Níl nasc suiteála aip GitHub Weblate bailí a thuilleadh. Tosaigh an suiteáil "
"arís."

