"Weblate could not confirm that you can administer this GitHub installation. "
"Start the installation again with a GitHub user who owns the account or can "
"administer the organization."
msgstr ""
"Ní raibh Weblate in ann a dhearbhú gur féidir leat an suiteáil GitHub seo a "
"riaradh. Tosaigh an suiteáil arís le húsáideoir GitHub ar leis an gcuntas nó "
"ar féidir leis an eagraíocht a riaradh."

msgid ""
"GitHub is still syncing the connected GitHub account. The connection is "
"pending and repositories might not appear yet. Try connecting the account "
"again later if they do not show up."
msgstr ""
"Tá GitHub fós ag sioncrónú an chuntais GitHub nasctha. Tá an nasc ar "
"feitheamh agus b'fhéidir nach mbeidh na stórtha le feiceáil fós. Déan "
"iarracht an cuntas a nascadh arís níos déanaí mura bhfeictear iad."

msgid ""
"The connected GitHub account was saved, but refreshing the repository list "
"failed. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Sábháladh an cuntas GitHub ceangailte, ach theip ar an liosta stórtha a "
"athnuachan. Déan iarracht arís i gceann nóiméid."

